    DisplaySet, #Doorwidth2C =24.625,          3.1.2 Door width is Less than or Equal to, 
    DisplaySet, #DoorCost2C =190*1.25*#MaterialCostGroup,                   Cost of a door (up to #DoorheightC" tall)   by   (up to #DoorWidth2C" wide), 
    Set, (#DoorDrawerType = "#DoorDrawerTypeName1")&(#Includeinsert=0)&(#DoorW>#Doorwidth1C)&(#DoorW<=#Doorwidth2C) & (#DoorH>#DoorHeightB)&(#DoorH<=#DoorHeightC): #Tempdoorcost = #DoorCost2C ,Set the Cost of This Door
