,Update V7.2.2 start
Displayset,#basicwhitecolorname=White, What do you name your base white material color?
,UpdateV7.2.2 end
Displayset,#2ndcolorFramedDrawerFrontCost=145*#ContrastMaterialCostGroup, Cost of Framed drawer front (add insert)2nd color
Displayset,#2ndcolorFlatEdgeBandDrawerFront=30*#ContrastMaterialCostGroup, Cost of Flat Edgeband drawer front -(use hashtagContrastMaterialCostGroupe to increase by the 2nd material multiplier)
Displayset, #DefaultWallBeddoor2ndcost=415*#ContrastMaterialCostGroup,Cost of your Twin wallbed single door 2nd material
Displayset, #AddmoldingtoDrawer=60, Cost of Applied Moulding on #DoorDrawerTypeName1 or #DoorDrawerTypeName2 Drawer

,**
Displayset,#Maxdoorwidth=37.5, Maximum door width for wood doors
Displayset,#Maxdrawerwidth=40, Maximum face width for all drawers

,Update V8.0 start
Displayset, #Mullioncost=20, For custom doors what do you charge per mullions? Will price based on doors selected from Sq. Panel, Sq. Glass, Arch Panel, Cath Panel in drawing.
,Update V8.0 end

