,**For Additional Custom Ordered Doors pricing Please Edit Special Order Doors Price List.csv file in your pricing folder.
,***************************************************************************************************************************

,           ***** Go back to A-Setup to change the method of pricing Doors *****

,Line below is managed in AA-User file under Door setup
Set, #PriceDrawerFronts =Yes,                 Price Drawer Fronts like Doors = Yes     OR     Include Drawer Fronts with Drawer Box cost = No  [No;Yes]


,Initialize a few variables
Set, #CostOfDoor = 0
Set, #DoorTypeFactor=1
,Update V7.2.9 start
,set, (#Endpanel=0):#UnitDoorArea=[(#UnitDoorArea+#DoorA)*num]:#UnitDoorArea=[(#UnitDoorArea+(#EndpanelH*#EndpanelW))]
,set, #UnitDoorArea=[(#UnitDoorArea+#DoorA)*num]
,set, #UnitDoorNum=[(#UnitDoorNum+1)*num]
,Update V7.2.9 end
,Update 7.2.2 start comment out line below
,Load,GetDoorStyleCost.pcb
,Load,GetDoorDrawerFinishCost.pcb
,Load,GetDoorDrawerInsertCost.pcb

,Price Doors by List is not used for Closet Factory
,DisplaySet,#PriceMethodDoors =Square Foot,         --------   PRICING METHOD FOR DOORS & DRAWER FRONTS - (By Square Foot)-(Fixed Cost) or (From Size Look Up List) [Square Foot;Fixed Cost;List]

set,(#PriceMethodDoors = "List"):#DoorCostMethod =List
set,(#PriceMethodDoors = "Square Foot"):#DoorCostMethod =Sqft
set,(#PriceMethodDoors = "Fixed Cost"):#DoorCostMethod =Fixed Cost
,Update V7.2.9 start
set,(#PriceMethodDoors = "Basic Plus"):#DoorCostMethod =Sqft
,Update V7.2.9 end

,**

Load, Door Pricing Method.pcb




,Set the Final Cost of Each Door
Set, #CostOfDoor =  [#CostOfDoor]       ,Add Handle and Hinge Cost to EACH DOOR




